{"id": "6th-t1-u1-059", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "6", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-6th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-oli-piranthathu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalam-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஒளி பிறந்தது' பாடப்பகுதியில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள டாக்டர் ஏ.பி.ஜே. அப்துல் கலாம் அவர்களின் உலகப் புகழ்பெற்ற பொன்மொழி எது?\nஅ) \"உண்மை பேசுங்கள்\"\nஆ) \"பொறுமை காப்பதே வெற்றி\"\nஇ) \"கனவு காணுங்கள்\"\nஈ) \"நேரத்தை வீணாக்காதீர்கள்\"", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ", "B": "ஆ", "C": "இ", "D": "ஈ"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 13-ல் 'கனவு காணுங்கள் என்பது அப்துல் கலாமின் பொன்மொழி' என்று தெளிவாகக் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which world-renowned golden maxim of Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam is featured in 'Oli Piranthathu'?\nA) 'Speak the truth'\nB) 'Patience is victory'\nC) 'Dream, Dream, Dream'\nD) 'Do not waste time'", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "A", "B": "B", "C": "C", "D": "D"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 13 clearly emphasizes 'Dream' (Kanavu Kaanungal) as Dr. Kalam's iconic message to youth."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": false, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "textbook", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "6", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "publication_year": "2025", "page": 13, "chapter": "lesson-03-oli-piranthathu", "section": null, "reference": "6th Std Tamil Term 1, Page 13", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["general_tamil", "std_6", "term_1", "quote"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "TNPSC Engine", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "Antigravity AI", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "6th-t1-u1-060", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "6", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-6th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-oli-piranthathu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-india-achievements", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அப்துல் கலாம் பட்டியலிட்ட 'சுதந்திர இந்தியாவின் வெற்றிகள்' குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. உணவு உற்பத்தியில் தன்னிறைவு அடைந்துள்ளோம்.\n2. தகவல் தொழில்நுட்பத் துறையில் மிகுதியான வளர்ச்சி பெற்றுள்ளோம்.\n3. செயற்கைக்கோள்களை ஏவும் திறன் மற்றும் அனைத்து வகையான அணு உலைகளையும் அமைக்கும் ஆற்றலைப் பெற்றுள்ளோம்.\n4. விண்வெளியில் 525 கிலோ எடையுள்ள ஆளில்லாச் செயற்கைக்கோளை நிலவுக்கு அனுப்பியுள்ளோம்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்றுகள் 1, 2 சரி; 3, 4 தவறு", "B": "கூற்றுகள் 1, 3, 4 சரி; 2 தவறு", "C": "கூற்றுகள் 2, 4 சரி; 1, 3 தவறு", "D": "அனைத்துக் கூற்றுகளும் சரியானவை"}, "explanation": "நான்கு கூற்றுகளும் பாடநூல் பக்கம் 12 மற்றும் 13-ல் கலாமின் பதிலில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள சுதந்திர இந்தியாவின் அறிவியல் வெற்றிகளாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding the 'Achievements of Independent India' listed by Dr. Abdul Kalam:\n1. Self-sufficiency in food production has been achieved.\n2. Tremendous advancements in Information Technology have been accomplished.\n3. High capability in launching satellites and establishing all classes of nuclear reactors.\n4. Sent an unmanned lunar probe weighing 525 kg to the Moon.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Statements 1 and 2 are correct; 3 and 4 are incorrect", "B": "Statements 1, 3, and 4 are correct; 2 is incorrect", "C": "Statements 2 and 4 are correct; 1 and 3 are incorrect", "D": "All statements are correct"}, "explanation": "All four statements accurately represent Pages 12-13 of the textbook."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [{"id": "S1", "content_ta": "உணவு உற்பத்தியில் தன்னிறைவு.", "content_en": "Self-sufficiency in food."}, {"id": "S2", "content_ta": "தகவல் தொழில்நுட்பத்தில் வளர்ச்சி.", "content_en": "Growth in IT."}, {"id": "S3", "content_ta": "செயற்கைக்கோள் ஏவுதல் & அணு உலைகள்.", "content_en": "Satellite launches & nuclear reactors."}, {"id": "S4", "content_ta": "நிலவுக்கு 525 கிலோ ஆளில்லா விண்கலம்.", "content_en": "525 kg unmanned lunar probe."}], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": false, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "textbook", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "6", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "publication_year": "2025", "page": 12, "chapter": "lesson-03-oli-piranthathu", "section": null, "reference": "6th Std Tamil Term 1, Page 12", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["general_tamil", "std_6", "term_1", "achievements"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "TNPSC Engine", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "Antigravity AI", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "